WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.190
On a speed graph, what do slope and area mean?

00:00:05.190 --> 00:00:12.010
The slope is the acceleration: how fast the speed changes.

00:00:12.010 --> 00:00:15.050
The area underneath is the distance.

00:00:15.050 --> 00:00:18.380
One graph, two stories.

00:00:18.380 --> 00:00:21.013
Read both.
